{"version":1,"content":"<p>昨日（18日）是重陽節，入境處統計數字顯示，本港各管制站共錄得出入境人次132.2萬，其中入境人次約62.9萬，出境人次約69.3萬。</p><p>最多人使用的管制站依次為羅湖、落馬洲支線及深圳灣口岸。</p><p>新皇崗口岸則錄得15.2萬出入境人次。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T04:19:08.017219+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T03:14:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T14:18:15.673285+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T04:17:34.308884+00:00","content_hash":"73e76e87539b30e727b3e470cbef5b0463992a6f3cdd72181a5ac9177995f428","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}